# Application mapper

Only `IMapper.cs` and `Mapper.cs` in the Application project root. All mapping is `Map(...)` overloads on those types.

No `*Mapping` classes, no `Mapping/` folder, no AutoMapper, no `ToContract`/`ToDto`/extension map methods outside `IMapper`/`Mapper`.

Register in `AddApplication()`: `services.AddScoped<IMapper, Mapper>()`.

```csharp
public interface IMapper
{
    Page Map(GrpcPage page);
    GrpcPage Map(Page page);
}
```
